      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TODD KEEPING (1) has missed the placings at his last two but was second at Mt Gambier three back and returns to Murray Bridge where he tends to run well. Key player on best and worth another chance. SKY KEEPING (2) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing third (22.97) at Gawler in a Grade 5 over 400m. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from three starts. Well-placed to take this out. MAKE SOME NOISE (8) was checked in the run when fifth in a Grade 5 at Angle Park last time over 342m, finishing 9 lengths from the winner (20.28). Has Box 8 this time where he has two wins. Gets chance to atone. MICKEY HALLER (4) deserves plenty of thought over this distance.",
